| !TestGLES: SDL 2.26's own test program testgles (OpenGL ES 1.1 (a spinning cube)), unchanged,
| built against riscos-mesa's SDL2. It opens a 640x480 desktop window;
| close it (or press Escape) to quit. Its log, including the frame rate
| when it quits, goes to the file Output in this application.
| Options: testgles --help lists them, e.g. --fullscreen, --vsync, --info all.
Set TestGLES$Dir <Obey$Dir>
Set TestGLES$Output /|<TestGLES$Dir>/Output
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 RMLoad System:Modules.SharedULib
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error !TestGLES needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 RMLoad System:Modules.ARMEABISupport
RMEnsure ARMEABISupport 0.00 Error !TestGLES needs ARMEABISupport
Run <TestGLES$Dir>.!RunImage
